The  driver provides support for the IOASIC baseboard audio found
on DEC 3000/300, 3000/500 and DEC  Personal  DECstation  systems.
The baseboard audio driver is based on the AMD 79c30 ISDN and au‐
dio  interface.   The  interface  is  only capable of playing and
recording 8kHz mu‐law audio.  The device driver appeared  in  The
name for the driver was adopted from the same driver in ULTRIX.
